{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p><a href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk/iphone-duo/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 今日在香港開售，開售前有人樂觀預期先達回收價可高出官方售價約 HK$5,000。實際上，早上最高只賺約 HK$3,700，中午回落至約 HK$2,800，到下午 3 時再跌至約 HK$2,600。其後價格重新反彈，到傍晚 6 時半，賺幅最高的夜空色 2TB 回升至約 HK$3,500，逼近早上高位。每位顧客限購兩部，以此型號計最多可賺約 HK$7,000。</p><figure><p><img alt=\"單手握持的 iPhone Duo 外螢幕顯示主畫面。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"636\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6878dba36253d2d095b2c561bb1ef84d5f197cd074fc9d6db11d8d727c737f63/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2Ff759568bd07a023134bd2224d296482b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><h2>最新先達回收價</h2><p>以下為 iPhonePriceHK 2026 年 10 月 23 日 18:33 的先達報價，並列出每部相對官方售價的賺幅。</p><p></p><p>Apple 香港列出的 <a href=\"https://www.apple.com/hk/iphone-duo/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">iPhone Duo</a> 官方售價分別為 256GB HK$17,499、512GB HK$19,299、1TB HK$22,799 及 2TB HK$27,999，提供夜空色及星光白色。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><p><img alt=\"多部不同角度的 iPhone Duo，展示外螢幕與內螢幕。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"614\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4c2f1e44a12b58cefc948b5d7122aef9c7d07b44d88936d82fa0626bc2260a0b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F45cc5446424b324b671b58a172f93c3a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><table><tbody><tr><td><p><strong>容量</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>官方售價</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>夜空色回收價（賺幅）</strong></p></td><td><p><strong>星光白色回收價（賺幅）</strong></p></td></tr><tr><td><p>256GB</p></td><td><p>HK$17,499</p></td><td><p>HK$20,550（+HK$3,051）</p></td><td><p>HK$20,000（+HK$2,501）</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>512GB</p></td><td><p>HK$19,299</p></td><td><p>HK$22,000（+HK$2,701）</p></td><td><p>HK$21,600（+HK$2,301）</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>1TB</p></td><td><p>HK$22,799</p></td><td><p>HK$25,600（+HK$2,801）</p></td><td><p>HK$24,700（+HK$1,901）</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>2TB</p></td><td><p>HK$27,999</p></td><td><p>HK$31,500（+HK$3,501）</p></td><td><p>HK$30,600（+HK$2,601）</p></td></tr></tbody></table><figure><p><img alt=\"白色 iPhone Duo 摺合後展示鏡頭模組及內螢幕。\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"506\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/c9cdf23844dc8ad2d5188b89226ca3dfe0ceef4ec92b3d7dc7ccc1876e3a169b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fnewmobilelife_722%2F98a9e926595ec1e5044c8e52e6641c59.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T13:45:31.167611+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":625,"images":3,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T13:27:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T01:18:54.285886+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T13:38:29.040557+00:00","content_hash":"6643b6d14dcea1f2911fefa2b8357514bcf7d5c0fbc98d8f1c9cacc91570be0c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}